window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Portal jumped to an island in a mysterious realm, Elara's life is saved by Prince Kage, who gets shot in the midst of his valiant efforts. Consciousness slipping, his fading words to her are to find the magical flower that can save him.<br> <br> Between the foreign terrain and a growing mountain of enemies, Elara faces crushing obstacles. Things are made far worse by her suppressed abilities and increasingly complicated feelings for the prince.<br> <br> To survive Celestria, Elara must depend on her mortal abilities until she can uncover a way to release her powers.<br> <br> Jealous maidens. A malicious Avkan king. And a witch in possession of a treasured artifact . . . <br> <br> Can Elara find the inner strength required to save herself and the Prince? Or will all that she is be lost to Celestria?<br> <br> Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
